00:09:27.277 --> 00:09:28.721
One more.

00:09:28.721 --> 00:09:29.888
Cha, cha, cha.

00:09:30.856 --> 00:09:31.797
Merengue!

00:09:31.797 --> 00:09:33.216
- I love this!

00:09:33.216 --> 00:09:34.049
