00:09:34.049 --> 00:09:37.216
Thank you guys so much for being here.

00:09:39.587 --> 00:09:40.609
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:09:40.609 --> 00:09:44.043
I made this video because
Jaye Cherie asked me to.

00:09:44.043 --> 00:09:45.551
If there's someone you'd like to vote on

00:09:45.551 --> 00:09:46.384
