00:09:49.689 --> 00:09:51.833
Finally, I want to give a quick
shout out to Jane Cassell.

00:09:51.833 --> 00:09:53.926
Jane, thank you so much for
picking up a copy of my book

00:09:53.926 --> 00:09:55.002
Your One Word,

00:09:55.002 --> 00:09:57.208
and for posting it on your
social media accounts,

00:09:57.208 --> 00:09:58.541
on your LinkedIn.

00:09:58.541 --> 00:10:00.049
I really appreciate the support,

00:10:00.049 --> 00:10:02.071
and I'm so glad that
you enjoyed the reading.

00:10:02.071 --> 00:10:03.277
So thank you guys again for watching.

00:10:03.277 --> 00:10:04.202
I believe in you.

00:10:04.202 --> 00:10:06.356
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself,

00:10:06.356 --> 00:10:08.088
and whatever your one word is,

00:10:08.088 --> 00:10:09.593
much love.

00:10:09.593 --> 00:10:10.426
I'll see you soon.

00:10:10.426 --> 00:10:12.759
(whooshing)

00:10:16.685 --> 00:10:18.507
- What motivates you to keep going?

00:10:18.507 --> 00:10:20.662
Because you really don't
have to do anything

00:10:20.662 --> 00:10:22.143
if you don't want to, you know?

00:10:22.143 --> 00:10:23.151
- You know what?

00:10:23.151 --> 00:10:24.818
I think that for me,

00:10:25.746 --> 00:10:27.747
it keeps me alive, like inside.

00:10:27.747 --> 00:10:31.247
Spiritually and just with my passion about

00:10:32.929 --> 00:10:36.511
what I want to be able
to teach someone else,

00:10:36.511 --> 00:10:37.914
and I think that it's important

00:10:37.914 --> 00:10:39.080
when they asked me to do this,

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:41.605
I thought, wow, what a great opportunity.

00:10:41.605 --> 00:10:44.772
I thought it was a such a perfect idea

00:10:46.871 --> 00:10:51.059
for a private school to
be able to bring this to,

00:10:51.059 --> 00:10:53.116
I thought I had something to share.

00:10:53.116 --> 00:10:56.555
You know, I've had to kind
of figure it out myself,

00:10:56.555 --> 00:10:57.439
from the ground up,

00:10:57.439 --> 00:10:59.834
taking kind of nothing and
making a business out of it,

00:10:59.834 --> 00:11:01.501
and figuring it out,

00:11:02.481 --> 00:11:04.862
and if I have anything
to offer somebody else,

00:11:04.862 --> 00:11:07.610
it would be so exciting for
me to be able to do that.

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:10.242
Instead of just my five kids,

00:11:10.242 --> 00:11:13.352
I can only bitch at them
for so many hours a day

00:11:13.352 --> 00:11:15.769
before they just tune me out,

00:11:16.624 --> 00:11:18.814
but to be able to have it
as an organized education

00:11:18.814 --> 00:11:20.740
and come in from time to time

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:23.153
and be able to give a seminar or lecture,

00:11:23.153 --> 00:11:26.956
and be a part of such an amazing process,

00:11:26.956 --> 00:11:28.817
especially an international school,

00:11:28.817 --> 00:11:32.343
because I love traveling so much,

00:11:32.343 --> 00:11:35.900
and I love learning
something new every day.

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:37.958
As long as you can keep on learning

00:11:37.958 --> 00:11:39.908
and then to be able to share something

00:11:39.908 --> 00:11:41.205
with someone else,

00:11:41.205 --> 00:11:43.122
I think that's amazing.

